                        "glosses": [
                            "to hear (repeatedly or frequently); iterative of слыха́ть (slyxátʹ), iterative of слы́шать (slýšatʹ)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "73ca6aaa-ac32-4533-8525-4cfbd812a6a5",
                                "sense_id": "642ce99d-4569-3920-a215-2e2ff38ac8a7",
                                "text": "Призна́юсь, с неда́внего вре́мени я начина́ю иногда́ слы́шать и ви́деть таки́е ве́щи, кото́рых никто́ ещё́ не ви́дывал и не слы́хивал.",
                                "translation": "For some little time past I hear and see things which no other man has heard and seen.",
                                "english": "For some little time past I hear and see things which no other man has heard and seen."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
